WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:09.100
Understand the bookings list
Review first-session bookings, including past and cancelled sessions. The summary shows scheduled, awaiting-approval and completed bookings.

2
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:17.300
Narrow the results
Filter by case owner, programme, session dates or booking dates. Status buttons narrow the list further. Clear filters restores all bookings.

3
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:24.900
Read a booking
Each row shows the learner, programme, owner, booking date, session date and time. Session times are displayed in UK time.

4
00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:32.363
Open a session
Open the learner record for more detail. An available meeting link opens Teams. A booking status does not confirm every attendee has accepted.
